Open the Blynk Mobile App.

Select your device.

Tap:

```text
Edit Dashboard
```

Add:

### Switch Widget

Configure:

| Setting | Value |
|----------|--------|
| Datastream | V0 |
| Mode | Switch |

Save the dashboard.

