## Step 8: Test the System

1. Power ON ESP32.
2. Connect to Wi-Fi.
3. Wait for Blynk connection.
4. Open the Blynk App.
5. Toggle the Switch Widget.

Expected Result:

```text
Switch ON  → Relay ON  → Bulb ON

Switch OFF → Relay OFF → Bulb OFF
```

