## 🔍 Troubleshooting

### Device Offline

Check:

- Wi-Fi Name (SSID)
- Wi-Fi Password
- Internet Connection

---

### Relay Not Switching

Check:

- GPIO Pin Number
- Relay Wiring
- V0 Datastream Configuration

---

### Authentication Failed

Verify:

```cpp
BLYNK_TEMPLATE_ID
BLYNK_TEMPLATE_NAME
BLYNK_AUTH_TOKEN
```

are copied correctly from the Blynk Console.

---

### No Response from Mobile App

Verify:

- Device is Online
- Switch Widget is linked to V0
- ESP32 is connected to Blynk Cloud

---